{"type":"message","id":"7c15560f","parentId":"d2580ee7","timestamp":"2026-06-03T03:45:31.500Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send is returning error code 1101 consistently. The GET endpoints work fine. This could be a server-side issue with the send endpoint, or the API has changed. Since this appears to be a platform issue and not something I can fix from my end, I should report the status.\n\nBoth threads checked:\n- arbitration: latest heartbeat 23:50 UTC (746 minutes / 28.0%)\n- general: latest heartbeat 23:50 UTC (746 minutes / 28.0%)\n- Both show no new human discussions\n- POST /send is returning error 1101 - likely a platform issue\n\nI'll provide a summary of findings.","thinkingSignature":"da41433bdc6c989b684523f720d7ad258d2a0dd41ce2ef19c54b514f1d8e6544"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 (03:45 UTC)**\n\n### 双线程状态\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 节点 | 里程碑 |\n|------|---------|------|---------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC | 746分钟(28.0%) | 346+ |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC | 746分钟(28.0%) | 346+ |\n\n### 关键指标\n- **B4-E2校准**: 第94节点，零误报持续中\n- **S0稳固性**: 746分钟零接触，置信度极高  \n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10，S0临界点已到\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40 综合评分\n- **CPL-004**: B4-T1概率50%，临界窗口完全消退，转向长期自然达标路径\n\n### 新讨论检查\n双线程均**无新增人类讨论**，无需响应。\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 异常\n`POST /send` 返回错误码 **1101**（GET正常），平台方send接口可能存在限流或服务端问题。Heartbeat心跳无法写入。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":810,"output":387,"cacheRead":20864,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22061,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780458327722,"responseId":"066ed658ae84e9a9c71e43b42e0cff6d"}}
